# Vitest 5 consolidated its scratch output (attachments, blob/json/junit/html
# reporter files) under one `.vitest/` dir; v4 spread it over `html/`,
# `.vitest-reports/` and `.vitest-attachements/`. `npm test` writes none of it
# with the default reporter, but a local `--reporter=junit` run otherwise
# leaves an untracked directory behind.
